Exergo licensing notice

Status: beta (0.1.x)

Educational exercise files that explicitly declare

    % Licenza: CC-BY-SA-4.0

are presented as materials intended for distribution under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license (CC BY-SA 4.0), subject to the
provenance and redistribution rights of the underlying material.

Official license information and legal code:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

This repository contains more than educational exercise text. Files that do not
carry an explicit license declaration, including software, scripts, simulation
engines, tests, CI configuration and other infrastructure, MUST NOT be assumed
to be licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 solely because they are stored in this
repository. A software license has not yet been adopted for those files.

For material imported or adapted from external sources, a license declaration in
metadata does not replace a provenance check. Before redistribution, confirm
that the author/source and applicable rights permit publication under the stated
terms. If provenance is uncertain, do not reuse or redistribute the material
until the question is resolved.

The project intends to complete the code-license and provenance review before
the first stable release.
